 Legend releases on November 5, 2026 in Hindi, Tamil, Telugu, Kannada and Malayalam, with an IMAX release. Here's how to pick a format and a seat for a three-hour-plus epic.\",\"category\":\"Indian Cinema\",\"categorySlug\":\"indian-cinema\",\"tags\":[\"Ramayana\",\"Ramayana: Rise of a Legend\",\"IMAX\",\"Ranbir Kapoor\",\"Yash\",\"Nitesh Tiwari\"],\"image\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/in5hdAhBrI4lMnVlK0Bx45rJu5g.jpg\",\"readingTime\":5,\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-21\",\"language\":\"en\",\"tmdbId\":656908,\"seriesSlug\":\"upcoming\"},{\"slug\":\"cinema-accessibility-captions-audio-description-seats\",\"title\":\"Accessible Cinema Guide: Closed Captions, Audio Description and the Best Wheelchair Seats\",\"description\":\"US cinemas must provide closed captioning and audio description devices for digital films. Here's what devices exist, how many a cinema has to keep, where wheelchair spaces must go, and how to pick the right seat for each need.\",\"category\":\"Guides\",\"categorySlug\":\"guides\",\"tags\":[\"Accessibility\",\"Closed Captions\",\"Audio Description\",\"Wheelchair Seating\",\"ADA\"],\"image\":\"/images/blog/cinema-accessibility-captions-audio-description-seats-hero.webp\",\"readingTime\":5,\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-03\",\"language\":\"en\",\"seriesSlug\":\"premium-formats\"},{\"slug\":\"cinemark-xd-vs-regal-rpx-vs-imax\",\"title\":\"Cinemark XD vs Regal RPX vs IMAX: Which US Premium Screen Should You Book?\",\"description\":\"XD and RPX are chain-owned big screens. IMAX and Dolby Cinema are licensed formats with a fixed spec. Here's what each one guarantees, what varies by location, and when the cheaper house format is the smarter ticket.\",\"category\":\"Comparisons\",\"categorySlug\":\"comparisons\",\"tags\":[\"Cinemark XD\",\"Regal RPX\",\"IMAX\",\"Dolby Cinema\",\"Premium Large Format\",\"USA\"],\"image\":\"/images/blog/cinemark-xd-vs-regal-rpx-vs-imax-hero.webp\",\"readingTime\":6,\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-03\",\"language\":\"en\",\"seriesSl